4-602.13 The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
1. Fryer - grease and dust accumulation on inner panel where mechanicals are located & grease accumulation on sides;
2. Lowboy cooler on cook line - bottom inside with general buildup and food debris;
3. Surface under grill - food debris and grease; 
4. Dish machine - top with dust and general debris accumulation;
5. Shelving in server alley - significant buildup of food debris in brackets & dust accumulation on lower shelf; and
6. Bottom inside prep coolers - especially the small cooler across from fryer where food debris and strong seafood odor were present.
Clean the aforementioned items.
 Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
